	"Description": "Hello everyone! \uD83C\uDF89\u00A0This time, I've created a total of 19 costume-themed mods.\n<br /> \n<br />These costumes are mainly inspired by the games Naraka: Bladepoint \uD83D\uDDE1️ and League of Legends ⚔️.\u00A0\n<br />Since I didn’t design any bottom pieces, feel free to pair them with the leggings from my previous mods! \uD83D\uDC56\n<br />\n<br />⚠️Note:\u00A0\u00A0I didn’t add extra animation frames, so the farmer’s legs might show up during certain movements.\u00A0\n<br />All the costumes I make have minimal differences between their four sides—unless there are special designs on the back (like the Sanrio collaboration series this time \uD83C\uDF80).\u00A0\n<br />Skip this mod if this bothers you.\uD83D\uDE0A\n<br />\n<br />[list]\n<br />[*]Naraka: Bladepoint × Sanrio Series \uD83C\uDF8A:\n<br />[/list]\n<br />Cinnamoroll \uD83D\uDC36: Headpiece | Top\n<br />\n<br />Hello Kitty \uD83D\uDC31: Headpiece | Top | Hairstyle\n<br />\n<br />Kuromi \uD83D\uDE08: Headpiece | Top | Hairstyle | candyeyepurple\n<br />\n<br />My Melody \uD83C\uDF38: Headpiece | Top | Hairstyle | candyeyeblack\n<br />\n<br />[list]\n<br />[*]Naraka: Bladepoint A-Tang Nurse Outfit :\n<br />[/list]Nurse Cap Hairstyle | Top | Eye Mask Accessory\n<br />\n<br />[list]\n<br />[*]League of Legends Gwen Crystal Rose Outfit :\n<br />[/list]Hairstyle | candyeyered | Top\n<br />\n<br />\n<br />Go all out to dress up your farmer—having fun is what matters most! \uD83E\uDD73\u00A0\n<br />Now I’m off to admire my own characters too~ \uD83D\uDC96",
